    <p class="mh">Students</p><a class="mt hero" href="/app#signup" data-cta="menu"><b>Create your free account</b><small>Free for every nursing student</small></a><a class="mt" href="/free-nclex-practice-exam"><b>NCLEX practice exam</b><small>85 to 150 adaptive items</small></a><a class="mt" href="/nclex-practice-questions"><b>Practice questions</b><small>All 8 NCLEX categories</small></a><a class="mt" href="/next-generation-nclex"><b>Next Generation NCLEX</b><small>Item types and case studies</small></a><a class="mt" href="/nclex-prioritization-questions"><b>Prioritization and delegation</b><small>Who first, who can do what</small></a><a class="mt" href="/nclex-dosage-calculation-practice"><b>Dosage calculation</b><small>Worked solutions</small></a><a class="mt" href="/nclex-lab-values"><b>Lab values</b><small>Normal ranges</small></a><a class="mt" href="/nclex-study-guides"><b>Study library</b><small>Free printable guides</small></a>
    <p class="mh">Nursing programs</p><a class="mt hero" href="/for-nursing-schools"><b>Vexcura for nursing schools</b><small>Pricing, pilots and program tools</small></a><a class="mt" href="/academic-ehr-for-nursing-students"><b>Academic EHR</b><small>Epic-style charting practice</small></a><a class="mt" href="/nursing-simulation-scenarios"><b>Simulation</b><small>Drills, telemetry, megacodes</small></a><a class="mt" href="/software"><b>Our software</b><small>The whole platform</small></a>
    <p class="mh">Vexcura</p><a class="mt" href="/about"><b>About</b><small>Who built it, and why</small></a><a class="mt" href="/app#signin"><b>Sign in</b><small>Already have an account</small></a>
   </div></details></nav></div></header><script>(function(){var d=document.querySelector(".mnav");if(!d)return;document.addEventListener("click",function(e){if(d.open&&!d.contains(e.target))d.open=false});document.addEventListener("keydown",function(e){if(e.key==="Escape"&&d.open){d.open=false;d.querySelector("summary").focus()}})})();</script><main><nav class="crumb w" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> › <span>NCLEX prep compared</span></nav><section class="hero w"><h1>NCLEX Prep Compared: What Each Program Includes</h1><p class="lead">Prices, question counts, and practice exams for the most-used NCLEX-RN prep programs, as listed on their websites (dates below the table). Most students don't need all of them. Here's how they fit together.</p><div class="cta"><a class="btn" href="/app#start/exam">Take the adaptive exam</a><a class="btn alt" href="/for-nursing-schools">Vexcura for nursing programs</a></div></section><div class="w"><h2>At a glance</h2><div class="tw"><table class="cmp"><thead><tr><th>Program</th><th>Price</th><th>Questions</th><th>Adaptive (CAT) exam</th><th>Also includes</th></tr></thead><tbody>
       <tr><td><b>Vexcura</b></td><td data-l="Price">Free for every nursing student with an account; schools license it for their programs (<a href="/for-nursing-schools#pricing">school pricing</a>)</td><td data-l="Questions">2,400+</td><td data-l="Adaptive (CAT) exam">Yes, unlimited</td><td data-l="Also includes">Academic EHR, proctored test-day mode with an integrity report, NGN case studies, ACLS megacodes, bedside simulation</td></tr>
       <tr><td><b>UWorld</b></td><td data-l="Price">$139 for 30 days to $449 for 730 days</td><td data-l="Questions">2,600 to 3,100+</td><td data-l="Adaptive (CAT) exam">Yes</td><td data-l="Also includes">Self-assessments (1 to 6 by plan); 7-day free trial with 50 questions</td></tr>
       <tr><td><b>Archer Review</b></td><td data-l="Price">From $79 for 1 month; $159 to $209 with a pass guarantee</td><td data-l="Questions">3,100+</td><td data-l="Adaptive (CAT) exam">Yes, with 30+ readiness assessments</td><td data-l="Also includes">Pass prediction; live reviews on higher plans; guarantee has conditions</td></tr>
       <tr><td><b>Kaplan</b></td><td data-l="Price">CAT + Qbank from $99; self-paced course from $349</td><td data-l="Questions">3,800+ (course)</td><td data-l="Adaptive (CAT) exam">3 full-length (course)</td><td data-l="Also includes">Videos, ebook, flashcards; money-back guarantee with conditions</td></tr>
       <tr><td><b>SimpleNursing</b></td><td data-l="Price">$60 per month, or $139 for 90 days</td><td data-l="Questions">4,500+</td><td data-l="Adaptive (CAT) exam">On the monthly and guarantee plans</td><td data-l="Also includes">1,200+ animated videos; 6 readiness assessments; pass-guarantee plan</td></tr>
       </tbody></table></div>
       <p class="src" style="color:var(--muted);font-size:14.5px">Taken from each company's own website on October 29, 2026; Kaplan, Archer Review and SimpleNursing prices re-checked on November 16, 2026. Sale prices and plans change often; confirm on the company's site before you buy. UWorld, Archer Review, Kaplan, and SimpleNursing are trademarks of their owners. Vexcura isn't affiliated with or endorsed by any of them.</p>
       <h2>What Vexcura does well</h2><ul><li><b>Unlimited full exams.</b> Take the adaptive exam as often as you like. It runs 85 to 150 items and stops by the same rules as the NCLEX.</li><li><b>Test-day conditions.</b> A locked screen, webcam checks, a clock that keeps running on breaks, and an integrity report.</li><li><b>Clinical simulation.</b> ACLS megacodes and bedside patients who change in real time.</li><li><b>Built for programs.</b> An Epic-style academic EHR, a clinical instructor workspace and LMS grade sync, licensed to schools and free for every student. <a href="/for-nursing-schools">See Vexcura for nursing schools</a>.</li></ul>
       <h2>Where paid programs give you more</h2><ul><li><b>More questions.</b> The paid banks listed above advertise 2,600 to 4,500 questions. Vexcura has 2,400+.</li><li><b>Video lessons and content review.</b> Vexcura tests you; it doesn't teach full content lectures.</li><li><b>Track record and guarantees.</b> Some programs offer pass guarantees with conditions. Vexcura is new and doesn't publish pass rates. Its <a href="/nclex-pass-guarantee">pass guarantee is a fee reimbursement</a>: the NCLEX-RN registration fee back, up to $200, for students who meet every condition and don't pass their first attempt after signing.</li></ul>
       <h2>A plan that works for most students</h2><ol><li>Use one question bank for daily volume. If money is tight, Vexcura's free public practice questions and study guides are a good place to start, and a free Vexcura account adds the full platform at no cost.</li><li>Take a full adaptive exam every week or two to track your readiness.</li><li>In the last two weeks, take at least one full exam in test-day mode, on a running clock, the way you'll test.</li></ol>
       <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><div class="faq"><h3>Is there a free alternative to UWorld for the NCLEX?</h3><p>Vexcura's public practice questions and study guides are free to use. The full platform, with adaptive (CAT) exams, NGN case studies and proctored test-day mode, is free for nursing students with a Vexcura account; nursing programs license it for their faculty and cohorts. It has fewer questions than the largest paid banks, so some students use both: a question bank for volume and Vexcura for full exams and test-day rehearsal.</p><h3>Do I need a paid NCLEX prep course to pass?</h3><p>Not necessarily. What matters most is steady practice with rationales, full-length timed exams, and reviewing your weak categories. A paid course adds more questions, videos, and sometimes a pass guarantee. Free tools can cover the practice exam and test-day rehearsal.</p><h3>Which NCLEX prep includes an adaptive (CAT) exam?</h3><p>All of the programs compared here include CAT exams in their plans. Vexcura's is included free with a Vexcura student account, with or without a school.</p><h3>Are these prices current?</h3><p>They were taken from each company's website on October 29, 2026; Kaplan, Archer Review and SimpleNursing prices were re-checked on November 16, 2026. Prices and plans change often, so check the company's site before you buy.</p></div><h2>Related</h2><ul class="rel"><li><a href="/free-nclex-practice-exam">Full adaptive NCLEX-RN practice exam</a></li><li><a href="/nclex-pass-guarantee">NCLEX pass guarantee: registration fee back if you qualify and don't pass</a></li><li><a href="/nclex-practice-questions">Free NCLEX practice questions by category</a></li><li><a href="/for-nursing-schools">Vexcura for nursing schools</a></li><li><a href="/academic-ehr-comparison">Academic EHR comparison (SimChart, EHR Go, DocuCare)</a></li><li><a href="/ati-score-report-study-plan">Turn your ATI score report into a study plan</a></li></ul></div><section class="band vxs-band"><div class="vxs-bg" data-vxs-i="0" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="vxs-sh" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="w"><h2>Free for every nursing student</h2><p>Create an account and get the full adaptive NCLEX-RN practice exam, 2,400+ cited questions, 8 NGN case studies, the Epic-style academic EHR and the simulations, with or without a school. Nursing programs license Vexcura for their cohorts and faculty, and every plan includes everything.</p><div class="cta"><a class="btn" href="/app#signup" data-cta="band">Create your free account</a><a class="btn alt" href="/for-nursing-schools">For nursing schools</a></div></div></section></main><footer class="foot mktf"><div class="w">
